%SIXMD 1
# @?KILL - TERMINATE A PROCESS

## @?OPERANDS

### @?PID
DECIMAL PROCESS ID TO TERMINATE.

## DESCRIPTION

KILL SENDS THE STANDARD TERM EVENT TO PID. THE EXISTING PROCESS EVENT AND
PERMISSION RULES ARE USED; KILL ADDS NO SEPARATE SIGNAL MECHANISM.

PID 0 IS NOT ACCEPTED.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - TERM EVENT DELIVERED
### @?1 - INVALID PID OR EVENT DELIVERY FAILED
